=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ VTOP @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt VTOP @VERSION@ for OpenVMS (vms-vtop): a btop-style system monitor, early test
1 'NOTICE
=prompt VTOP is distributed under the MIT licence. This is an early test release.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [VTOP]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for VTOP (vms-vtop)
    At boot, add to SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:VTOP$STARTUP.COM
    For users, in SYS$MANAGER:SYLOGIN.COM or their LOGIN.COM:
    $ @VTOP$ROOT:[000000]VTOP$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE VTOP deassigns VTOP$ROOT and VTOP. Options files
(SYS$LOGIN:VTOP.INI) are users' own files and are kept.
